3312 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Automated ECG classification is currently dominated by Deep Learning \050DL\051 architectures\056 While powerful\054 these models often lack the transparency required for clinical decision support\056 This study evaluates the performance\055interpretability trade\055off by comparing classical statistical models against state\055of\055the\055art DL approaches in a classification task \050NORM\054 MI\054 HYP\054 STTC\054 CD\051 using the PTB\055XL and PTB\055XL\053 datasets\056 In particular\054 different multi\055label approaches have been tested\054 evaluated and compared with DL benchmarks\054 as well as Functional Data Analysis applied to the time series\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 3313 0 R
     /Pg 3306 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

