3356 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We tried some techniques to reduce the dimensionality of the dataset\072 using BR XGBoost as the reference model\056\n\nmRMR \050Maximum Relevance\054 Minimum Redundancy\051\072 Evaluates global relevance\054 strictly pairwise\056\nTreeSHAP \050applied on BR XGboost\051\072 Exact local attribution\054 natively handles non\055linearity\054 however it does not address features correlation\056 \nElastic Net \050Using tuned \261 hyperparameter\051\072 Preserves correlated lead groups\054 but fails due to linear assumptions\056\nLASSO \050\0231\013 Regularization\051\072 Fails on linearity\056\050\n)
     /K [ 25 ]
     /P 3357 0 R
     /Pg 3306 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
