3362 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In this section we present our main results related to the superclasses classification task\056\n\nSensitivity\054 specificity\072 Our goal in the choice of the thresholds was to maximise the sensitivity for the the superclasses linked to diseases and specificity for the NORM superclass\056)
     /K [ 28 ]
     /P 3363 0 R
